// unrestricted_unserialize: flags the sink to parse the base64-decoded
// {{ var_name }} cookie value with PHP's bare unserialize() -- no
// `allowed_classes` restriction, so any class the byte stream names is
// reconstructed, and any magic method it defines (__wakeup()/__destruct())
// runs as a real side effect of deserializing. Safety matrix:
// effect=no_effect.
